WEBVTT

NOTE key=3f73416f0fff0113

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.760
One night, a neighbour found Juha on his knees under a street lamp.

2
00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:07.129
"What are you doing?" he asked.

3
00:00:07.629 --> 00:00:11.344
"I lost my key," said Juha. "Help me look for it."

4
00:00:11.844 --> 00:00:15.153
They searched together for an hour and found nothing.

5
00:00:15.653 --> 00:00:18.614
"Are you sure you lost it here?" the neighbour asked.

6
00:00:19.114 --> 00:00:22.864
"No," said Juha. "I lost it inside my house."

7
00:00:23.364 --> 00:00:25.837
"Then why are we looking in the street?"

8
00:00:26.337 --> 00:00:28.334
Juha pointed at the lamp.

9
00:00:28.834 --> 00:00:30.889
"Because the light is better here."

10
00:00:31.389 --> 00:00:34.593
The neighbour went home thinking about his own life.
